  "_comment": "Bargain Watch config. All management happens here in the repo (protected by your GitHub login) - the dashboard itself is read-only. 'catalog_ids': '5' (Men) is the default for every search, but any watch can override it with its own 'catalog_ids' to search outside menswear entirely - used for the camera (3054) and hi-fi (3683) watches, which also set 'require_brand_match': false since they're category searches, not single-brand ones. 'my_sizes' powers the your-size flag per category. 'discovery_pool' brands rotate automatically: 3 are scanned each day and tagged as Discovery on the feed. 'rrp' is a rough typical retail price used for discount scoring - tune as needed.",
